  "title": "Nice and Dense Filipino Beets Robata-Style Lechon",
  "description": "A rich and flavorful Filipino-inspired dish featuring beets, lechon, and robata-grill, perfect for a lazy Sunday. This recipe is Jain-friendly and features a dense, spicy flavor profile.",
