  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata-grill to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a blender or food processor, combine beetroot, lemon juice, coconut oil, onion, garlic, anise, black pepper, apple cider vinegar, brown sugar, and water. Blend until smooth.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a large bowl and refrigerate for at least 2 hours or overnight.",
    "Thread the mixture onto bamboo skewers, leaving a 1-inch space between each piece.",
    "Grill the skewers over medium-high heat for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally, or until the beets are tender and slightly charred.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot."
  ],
